+## Symbolic links
+
+Symbolic links in ZIP and squashfs archives are skipped by default, with a
+notice suggesting `-l/--links` to include them.
+
+With `--links`, symbolic links appear as files with a `.rclonelink` suffix.
+Their contents are the link target path and their size is the length of that
+path. Links are not followed within the archive, including dangling links and
+links to directories.
+
+To recreate the links when copying to a local filesystem, use `--links`:
+
+```sh
+rclone copy --links :archive:s3:bucket/test.zip /tmp/out
+```
+
 ## Hashes
 
 Which hash is supported depends on the archive type. Zip files use
